# Always push to GitHub

The owner never pushes. After finishing work that should go live:

1. Commit the relevant files (not secrets, not `public/banners/`, not banner scripts unless asked).
2. **Immediately `git push -u origin HEAD`** to `main`. Do not ask first. Do not wait for the owner.
3. Give the VPS `git pull` + build command after a successful push.

Remote: `https://github.com/levbakatin110-glitch/lwlwlwall7B.git`, branch `main`.
